# Falcon devices CSV
#
# Format (CSV with header):
#   DevEUI,Name,AppKey,DeviceProfile
#
# - DevEUI:        16 hex chars (8 bytes), case insensitive (printed on the sensor sticker)
# - Name:          any human-readable name, no commas
# - AppKey:        32 hex chars (16 bytes), case insensitive
# - DeviceProfile: name of a profile from scripts/device-profiles.csv. If empty,
#                  falls back to DEVICE_PROFILE_NAME env var (default profile).
#
# Lines starting with '#' are ignored.
# Header line is also ignored automatically.
#
# To activate per-deployment:
#   1. cp scripts/devices.csv.example scripts/devices.csv
#   2. Edit scripts/devices.csv with the real DevEUIs/AppKeys for this site.
#   3. docker compose up -d chirpstack-init
#
DevEUI,Name,AppKey,DeviceProfile
00112233aabbccdd,Sensor-Greenhouse-01,00112233445566778899AABBCCDDEEFF,LSN50v2
00112233aabbccde,Soil-Field-A-01,00112233445566778899AABBCCDDEE00,LSE01
00112233aabbccdf,Rain-Sensor-Field,00112233445566778899AABBCCDDEE11,WSC1-L
